\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"Download free Wilhelm Scream SFX voiceovers – screams, shouts and shrieks for Halloween, horror, or parody content. Free for personal use with credit.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2022-09-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Shrieks, Shouts and Screams"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>That unmistakable Wilhelm Scream, plus new shouts, shrieks, and movie-style SFX – all performed by British voiceover artist Guy Harris.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>What is the Wilhelm Scream?</h2>\r\n<p>The Wilhelm Scream is Hollywood’s most iconic scream effect, used in over 400 films and TV shows. It originated from the 1951 film <em>Distant Drums</em>, where a character lets out the now-famous scream after being shot. You’ve heard it in <strong>Star Wars</strong>, <strong>Indiana Jones</strong>, and loads of others.<br>\r\nThese are my own takes, ideal for <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voiceovers\">Halloween projects</a>, <a href=\"/spooky-halloween-laughs\" title=\"Spooky Halloween Laughs\">spooky promos</a>, and <a href=\"/joker-voice\" title=\"Joker Voice\">villain voiceovers</a>. Credit VoiceoverGuy and you’re good to go for personal use.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0IhG9vy8G1Q","title":"Shrieks, Shouts and Screams","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/wilhelm-scream-shreek-shout-sfx-voiceover-film.jpg","alt":"Free Wilhelm Scream and Halloween SFX Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Free Wilhelm Scream Variations & Horror SFX</h2>\r\n<p>Download my custom scream recordings, a mix of blood-curdling shouts, shrieks, and horror SFX inspired by the classic Wilhelm Scream. Great for Halloween trailers, YouTube videos, or horror parodies.<br>\r\nLooking for something even darker? Try my <a href=\"/evil-character-voiceover\" title=\"Evil Character Voiceover\">evil character voice</a> or <a href=\"/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice\" title=\"Ghost Face Voice\">Ghost Face impression</a> for that extra chill. <br>\r\nNeed a clean WAV or mp3 without effects? Get in touch and I’ll send a broadcast-ready version. Just remember to credit VoiceoverGuy.</p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Looking for More Halloween Voiceovers?</h2>\r\n<p>Need more spooky sounds? I’ve got a full range of Halloween voices from <a href=\"/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice\" title=\"Ghost Face Scream Voice\">Ghost Face-style voices</a> to <a href=\"/joker-voice\" title=\"Joker Voice\">Joker-style villain laughs</a>, <a href=\"/evil-character-voiceover\" title=\"Evil Character Voiceover\">deep evil characters</a> and <a href=\"/spooky-halloween-laughs\" title=\"Spooky Halloween Laughs\">spooky Halloween laughs</a>. <br>\r\nClick around the site or check out the <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voiceovers\">main Halloween voiceover page</a> for more terrifying treats!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/character-voiceovers.jpg","alt":"Free Wilhelm Scream and Halloween SFX Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Can I use the Wilhelm Scream commercially?</h2>\r\n<p>If you want to use these screams in a commercial, ad, trailer or YouTube video with monetisation – please <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Get in touch\">get in touch</a> to discuss usage and rates. <br>\r\nThese are free for personal or parody use with a credit to VoiceoverGuy. But for anything broadcast or brand-related, let’s sort the licensing together. Simple!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Shrieks, Shouts and Screams","pageUrl":"wilhelm-scream-shreek-shout-sfx-voiceover-film"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","916",{"href":"/hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover.jpg","alt":"hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Natural Voiceover for Hotels.com"}]]}],["$","$L3","545",{"href":"/domino-express-voice-over","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/domino-express-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Domino Express Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Energetic English voice over"}]]}],["$","$L3","770",{"href":"